data: {"id": "6481e58b0a714566-thinking-parallel_evidence-912", "run_id": "6481e58b0a714566", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 身份与生命周期**：`aiops-case-v05/workload` (UID `b9e687f5-702b-4d01-bfb9-2df4ff23ba91`)，调度到 `node2`，创建时间 `2026-09-11T10:16:10Z`，当前 `phase=Pending`，容器 `app` 状态 `Waiting/ContainerCreating`，**重启次数=0**，从未进入 Running。\n2. **Metrics**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1 (reason=ContainerCreating)`；`kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)/Failed(0)/Running(0)`；`restarts=0`。量化确认异常仍在持续。\n3. **Kubernetes Events**（关键根因信号）：\n   - **`FailedMount`** (x19 over 22m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789123144428, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

