data: {"id": "6481e58b0a714566-final", "run_id": "6481e58b0a714566", "seq": 917, "ts_ms": 1789123160070, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，挂载 volume 'input' 持续失败超过 22 分钟 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (`fact-f6020913cb33`) | 直接指出挂载失败的原因为 ConfigMap key 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition` (`fact-719315eb555b`) | 确认挂载卷挂载超时，持续 22 分钟 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Container status: [app] waiting reason: ContainerCreating` (`fact-f4c63e193093`) | 确认容器当前处于挂载/启动阻塞状态 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (`fact-6b249f7a0209`) | 从指标维度印证容器处于等待挂载或启动状态 |\n\n上述 K8s 事件明确给出了失败机制（引用不存在的 key），且被 K8s 状态、指标和超时事件相互印证。Logging 与 Tracing 因 Pod 未启动而不可用，不影响该结论的确定性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺少 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载 volume 'input' 时 key 校验失败 → MountVolume.SetUp 失败 → Pod aiops-case-v05/workload 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 的卷配置错误。Pod Spec 中定义的 volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `workload-input` 中的 key `unavailable-key`，但该 key 在 ConfigMap 中并不存在（证据 `fact-f6020913cb33`）。这导致 kubelet 在 `MountVolume.SetUp` 阶段无法挂载该卷，并持续失败超过 22 分钟（证据 `fact-719315eb555b`），最终导致容器一直处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 `fact-f4c63e193093`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 35.9s (Evidence 28.4s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.606, "metrics": {"run_id": "6481e58b0a714566", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.613330364227295, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62613.330364227295, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 59766.327142715454, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 6230.591773986816, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2500.908851623535}, "nodes": {"laye